# SECTION 5 — RETURN   b104-143   (3:30 - 4:40)
# b104 unison blow.  b105- everything locks into ONE 3+3+2 pattern.
# Gathering cycle (b105), theme in horns + men (b113), theme 8va in
# trumpets + full choir (b121), the Hammer bVI-bVII-i (b129), oroshi roll
# on the dominant (b137), one huge D MAJOR chord (b141), last DON! (b143).

